---
module: resource_loading
func_id: load-linked-files
---

***conformance tests***

# text-file
Loading the link {text `Notes`, target `notes.md`} of module `my_thing`, with `notes.md` holding `# hello`, gives {`notes.md`: `# hello`}.

# small-base64-is-allowed
Loading a file holding `token=` and 8092 `A` characters gives its text.

***acceptance tests***

# binary-file
Loading `icon.png` holding PNG bytes that are not valid UTF-8 for module `my_thing` raises `UnsupportedResourceType` whose message holds `icon.png`, `binary file` and `my_thing`.

# missing-file
Loading `missing.md` for module `my_thing` raises `FileNotFoundError` whose message holds `missing.md` and `my_thing` and not `--template-dir`.

# base64-blob
Loading `request.txt` holding `curl -d 'selfie_image=` and 8292 `A` characters for module `my_thing` raises `UnsupportedBase64Content` whose message holds `request.txt`, `my_thing` and `8292`.
